          <div><h3 class="font-medium text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 text-sm mb-1">Add a Base Plate for Stability</h3><p class="text-xs text-surface-500 leading-relaxed">Enable the base plate option to add a flat bottom surface. This makes relief models stand upright for display, improves bed adhesion during printing, and gives the print a professional finished look.</p></div>
